WHAT THIS COVERS
----------------

This license governs:

  1. The OXPID model weights, checkpoints, and tokenizer artifacts produced by
     training runs in this repository, including but not limited to any artifact
     published under the name OXPID or a version thereof.

  2. The original source code authored by Aniket Kumar in this repository, as
     enumerated under "WHAT IS ORIGINAL TO THIS REPOSITORY" in NOTICE.

  3. The OXPID name, wordmark, and associated branding.

It does NOT cover the source code inherited from nanochat
(https://github.com/karpathy/nanochat), which remains under the MIT license
reproduced in LICENSE. See NOTICE for the boundary between the two.

Trained model weights are a separate work from the training code that produced
them, so the MIT terms in LICENSE place no obligation on the OXPID weights.

